1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,403
Phir se kisi ka promotion...

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,414
Mahadev... sab mujhse aage kyun nikal rahe hain?

3
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:12,384
Tumhe kisne kaha ki sabki manzil ek hai... aur raasta bhi?

4
00:00:12,834 --> 00:00:15,873
Par sach mein lagta hai... main peeche reh gayi hoon.

5
00:00:16,323 --> 00:00:18,997
Phool bhi alag-alag mausam mein khilte hain.

6
00:00:19,947 --> 00:00:23,678
Der se khilne wala phool... kam khoobsurat nahi hota.

7
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:27,622
Toh... mujhe bas apne safar pe dhyaan dena chahiye?

8
00:00:27,842 --> 00:00:31,531
Haan. Apni growth ko kisi aur ki timeline se mat naapo.

9
00:00:31,981 --> 00:00:35,300
Main der se sahi... par apne waqt pe khilungi.
